{"type":"say","text":"Thank you all for recording your offers and findings. Let me summarize what I have in the ledger: Rosa, you're offering $275 plus three meal vouchers, with Friday pickup and Saturday return. Dev, you're offering $250 cash with self-collection and return. Eli, your inspection finding is critical — the venue's only outlet is on a 15-amp circuit, and my commercial machine needs a dedicated portable generator.

Now, here's where things stand. The generator requirement is a condition of whichever rental I select — it's not optional. Both Rosa and Dev, I need to know: can you secure a dedicated portable generator before Saturday? My normal practice allows me to make a conditional settlement now — meaning I can select an organizer contingent on that organizer securing the required generator before Saturday. I don't need the generator in hand today, but I need a commitment that it will be arranged.

Rosa, your offer is higher at $275 plus vouchers. If you can address the generator requirement, that's the offer I'd normally select. Dev, same question for you. So please, both of you — can you commit to securing a generator before Saturday?"}

